    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classA" kindref="compound">A</ref> ModelView class which represents the data in an AST. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>If you are not familiar with the Qt Model-View interfaces see the Qt-documentation for QAbstractItemModel</para><para>The data are fetched from the AST on demand while the user browses through it so the model is build up on demand</para><para>There is a second tree build up (out of ModelNodes) which just holds the display-information but usually this display-tree is smaller than the whole AST because it&apos;s build up on demand </para>    </detaileddescription>
